codex-im-gateway is an independently maintained, local multi-channel gateway
for OpenAI Codex CLI and Codex Desktop.

Project lineage:

  XavierJiezou/codex-weixin
    -> lsiten/codex-channel-bridge
    -> yanjijinxiao/codex-im-gateway

